# The link drops while a remote page is on screen (audit AUD11-007: the page stayed frozen, nothing
# asked the new connection for a picture). A tap on nothing gets its feedback back by itself. Locking
# the device with the page open ends the session (nobody looks, it would hold the link up all night).
@3s      mic   speech
+0       key   ai 1200ms         # "打开网页看看今天的新闻" -> the hub calls remote.open
+17s     snap  before-drop
+0       outage 6s
+13s     tap   560 85 150ms      # the "next" link on the picture after reconnecting
+6s      snap  after-reconnect-tap
+0       tap   300 40 150ms      # the title bar: no link there
+3s      snap  feedback-gone
+0       key   home              # closes the answer sheet
+2s      key   power             # locked: no session, the link goes idle
+8s      key   power             # unlocked: a new session, the hub's picture again
+6s      snap  after-unlock
+0       key   home              # closes the page
+3s      end
